Viewer: every window size renegotiates at its sharpest resolution (2026-10-23).

Sharing one stream between window shapes made a small window soft and, in portrait, cramped. Each window
size is now its own CarPlay session at suggestedResolution's size (CSS size times the pixels used, long
side 1280 to 1920/2560), so the 2/3 window is 1280x848 again and the 1/3 1082x1280. Every size change
reconnects once; automatic display no longer uses view areas. The view-area code and its tests stay for
now.

